    "result": "Done! I've implemented the one-line summary feature for frai-gate:\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **`renderSummary()` function** in `src/gate/report.ts`:\n   - Returns `BLOCK 0/7: structure` when gate section is missing\n   - Returns `<VERDICT> <answered>/<total>` where `answered` = checks without block findings, `total` = 7\n   - Appends `: check-id1, check-id2` for any blocks found, in GATE_CHECKS order\n   - Warnings don't reduce the answered count\n\n2. **`--summary` flag** in `frai-gate check`:\n   - Prints only the one-line summary instead of full report\n   - Exit codes unchanged (1 on BLOCK, 0 otherwise)\n   - `--json` takes priority if both flags given\n\n3. **Documentation**: Updated HELP text with example format\n\n4. **Tests**: Added 7 comprehensive test cases in `src/gate/report.test.ts`\n\n5. **Export**: Added `renderSummary` to `src/index.ts`\n\n\u2705 Build passes: `pnpm --filter frai-gate build`  \n\u2705 Tests pass: 18 tests total (7 new + 11 existing)",
